{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"横浜サマーコンファレンスに\n参加しました！\n勉強になりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"JC-AIDについてトークショー！\n便利な非常食、\nたくさんの人に広まればいいな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブ！\n♪ガールズルール\n♪走れ！Bicycle\n♪制服のマネキン(れな)\n♪世界で一番孤独なLover\n♪君の名は希望(ねね)\n♪おいでシャンプー(れな)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"不安でしたが、\n乃木ふぁむたくさんーーー！\n盛り上がってよかったなー\nありがとうございました\n嬉しかったー！ふややや"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のセトリは上下の移動\n激し過ぎました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもねー\n端から端までみなさんの顔見れて\nむしろラッキーだったー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブはいいですね。\nほんとに。\n夏休みはイベントライブ\nいっぱいして汗いっぱいかいて\nみんなで盛り上がりたいなー\nだからツアー楽しみ過ぎるんだよねー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、そうなの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私、夏休み入ったから\n気分がるんるんしてるんだよね♪\nなっつやっすみーなっつやっすみー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/20/2462863/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/20/2462863/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/20/2462863/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふうっふふうっふ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/20/2462863/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真洋"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/20/2462863/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はなくそほじほじ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"びっくりしました！\nコメントいっぱい...\nありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今読んでるところよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/20/2462863/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は京都全握だよ。\n初披露する曲あーるよ。なんてね\nなんてね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/20/2462863/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみー♪\n抽選ドキドキしますねーふー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/20/2462863/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かなべちょりん\nかなは私でストレス発散してるって。\n最近ずーっとめんどくさい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/20/2462863/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"電池切れのかなはひどいよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/20/2462863/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"玲香も"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/20/2462863/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/20/2462863/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めんどくさーい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/20/2462863/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふふ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、\nうしろに隠れてるのかなべちょだよ\n怖がらないで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}